flowchart TB
    U[Person gives Manus a pinned repo URL] --> M[Person authorizes host; Manus verifies access]
    M --> K{Approve install and sign-in if needed}
    K --> C[OpenLLM CLI launches Claude Code]
    C --> A[Claude Code session]
    C --> X[OpenLLM stdio MCP tools]
    X --> A
    C --> R{Person approves model route and request}
    R -->|BYOK| G[Hosted OpenLLM gateway]
    R -->|Subscription| D[Local OpenLLM daemon]
    G --> V[Configured LLM provider]
    D --> V
    A -. reviewed changes .-> W[(Optional code workspace)]
    classDef primary fill:#e8f4fd,stroke:#225aa5,color:#152943;
    classDef route fill:#f5f0ff,stroke:#7865b5,color:#312452;
    class M,C,A primary;
    class R,K,G,D,X route;
